tion\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"summary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div><b id=\"count-members\">0</b><span>Private member profiles</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div><b id=\"count-attendance\">0</b><span>Attendance records</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div><b id=\"last-published\">Not yet</b><span>Last publication</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<nav aria-label=\"Administrator sections\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button data-view=\"attendance\" class=\"active\">Attendance</button\n\t\t\t\t\t><button data-view=\"members\">Members &amp; transfers</button\n\t\t\t\t\t><button data-view=\"doctrine\">Doktrina</button\n\t\t\t\t\t><button data-view=\"setup\">Setup &amp; import</button>\n\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\t\t<section id=\"attendance-view\" class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Update a week's attendance</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tChoose the day attended. Leave it blank for absence. Save the batch, then publish when\n\t\t\t\t\t\tyou finish. All comments are private and are never published.\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"toolbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"year\">Year</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t><select id=\"year\"></select>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"week\">Week</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t><select id=\"week\"></select>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button id=\"save-attendance\" class=\"primary\">Save attendance</button\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><button id=\"save-publish\">Save &amp; publish</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"table-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Member</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Day attended</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Private comment</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody id=\"attendance-rows\"></tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p id=\"attendance-note\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<details open>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<summary>Year overview · hover over a marked cell for its private comment</summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"private-overview\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</details>\n\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section id=\"members-view\" class=\"panel\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"toolbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Members &amp; monitoring periods</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button id=\"add-member\" class=\"primary\">Add a member</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"sensitive\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBirthdates, mobile numbers, addresses, gender and Kap are private. A transfer ends\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmonitoring without deleting historical attendance.\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"table-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Name</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Kap / gender</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Private contact</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Monitoring periods</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Manage</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody id=\"member-rows\"></tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section id=\"doctrine-view\" class=\"panel\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"toolbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Doktrina · private</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button id=\"add-doctrine\" class=\"primary\">Add Doktrina record</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Each invited person is linked to the inviting member's permanent ID.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"table-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Name</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Invited by</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Status</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>Manage</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody id=\"doctrine-rows\"></tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section id=\"setup-view\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Restore private comments</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAfter importing the matching members, select your private comment backup. This file\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstays in your private Google records.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<input\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid=\"comment-backup\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"file\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taccept=\"application/json,.json\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Private comment backup\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Connect GitHub publishing</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUse a fine-grained token limited to <b>zaqxen/purok-attendance</b>, with Contents\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tread/write. Its value is stored only in your private Google script properties and is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnever returned to the browser.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<form id=\"publishing-form\" class=\"fields\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"github-token\">Repository-scoped token</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"github-token\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" required />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"admin-url\">Your deployed Google administrator URL (/exec)</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t><input\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid=\"admin-url\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"url\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tplaceholder=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/…/exec\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trequired\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"primary\">Save publishing connection</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span id=\"connection-status\" class=\"muted\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPublication puts only approved public attendance fields into GitHub. Public files and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttheir repository history can be read by anyone.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"panel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Import the existing workbook once</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tImport into an empty application workbook. Review name matches and legacy markers\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfirst. <b>X</b> and pre-arrival/post-transfer <b>1</b> weeks are excluded. A\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>1</b> between actual attendances counts as present. Existing cell notes are\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\timported as private notes.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"toolbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\" style=\"flex: 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"legacy-source\">Original Google Sheet URL or ID</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"legacy-source\" placeholder=\"Paste your original spreadsheet link\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button id=\"preview-import\">Review import</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"import-preview\" hidden></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</main>\n\t\t<dialog id=\"member-dialog\">\n\t\t\t<form id=\"member-form\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dialog-top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 id=\"member-title\">Add member</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>×</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"member-id\" type=\"hidden\" />\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fields\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"firstName\">First name</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"firstName\" required maxlength=\"100\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"lastName\">Last name</label><input id=\"lastName\" required maxlength=\"100\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"birthDate\">Birthdate · private</label><input id=\"birthDate\" type=\"date\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"mobile\">Mobile · private</label><input id=\"mobile\" maxlength=\"100\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"address\">Address · private</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><textarea id=\"address\" maxlength=\"500\"></textarea>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"gender\">Tauhin · gender</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><select id=\"gender\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\">Unspecified</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"B\">B · Babae</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"L\">L · Lalake</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"kap\">Kap</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"kap\" list=\"kap-list\" maxlength=\"30\" required /><datalist id=\"kap-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"K\"></option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"B\"></option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"HDB\"></option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</datalist>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"status\">Private status</label><input id=\"status\" maxlength=\"100\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"member-year\">Monitoring / classification effective year</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"member-year\" type=\"number\" min=\"2000\" max=\"2099\" required />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"member-week\">First monitored week / classification effective week</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"member-week\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"53\" required />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tOnly Kap K or B starts monitoring. Classification changes take effect from the selected\n\t\t\t\t\tweek and retain earlier history.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"actions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>Cancel</button\n\t\t\t\t\t><button class=\"primary\">Save member</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</dialog>\n\t\t<dialog id=\"transfer-dialog\">\n\t\t\t<form id=\"transfer-form\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dialog-top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 id=\"transfer-title\">Record transfer</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>×</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"transfer-member\" type=\"hidden\" />\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fields\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"transfer-type\">Transfer</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><select id=\"transfer-type\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"in\">Transfer in</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"out\">Transfer out</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"transfer-year\">Reporting year</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"transfer-year\" type=\"number\" min=\"2000\" max=\"2099\" required />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"transfer-week\">Effective week</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"transfer-week\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"53\" required />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tThe arrival week is included; the departure week is excluded. The member and historical\n\t\t\t\t\tattendance remain stored.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"actions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>Cancel</button\n\t\t\t\t\t><button class=\"primary\">Save transfer</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</dialog>\n\t\t<dialog id=\"doctrine-dialog\">\n\t\t\t<form id=\"doctrine-form\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dialog-top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Doktrina record · private</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>×</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"doctrine-id\" type=\"hidden\" />\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fields\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"doctrine-name\">Name</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"doctrine-name\" required maxlength=\"200\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"inviterId\">Inviting member</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><select id=\"inviterId\" required></select>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"caretaker\">Tagapag-alaga</label><input id=\"caretaker\" maxlength=\"200\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"doctrine-mobile\">Mobile</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"doctrine-mobile\" maxlength=\"100\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"doctrine-status\">Status</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"doctrine-status\" maxlength=\"100\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"doctrine-notes\">Private notes</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><textarea id=\"doctrine-notes\" maxlength=\"1500\"></textarea>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"actions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>Cancel</button\n\t\t\t\t\t><button class=\"primary\">Save record</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</dialog>\n\t\t<dialog id=\"period-dialog\">\n\t\t\t<form id=\"period-form\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dialog-top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Correct a monitoring period</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>×</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"period-id\" type=\"hidden\" />\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fields\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"period-start\">Arrival week · Tuesday</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"period-start\" type=\"date\" required />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"period-end\">Departure week · Tuesday, or leave blank</label\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><input id=\"period-end\" type=\"date\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\tArrival counts; departure is excluded. Attendance records are retained, but records\n\t\t\t\t\toutside the corrected period are excluded from public reports.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"actions\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" data-close>Cancel</button\n\t\t\t\t\t><button class=\"primary\">Save correction</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</dialog>\n\t\t<script>\n\t\t\tconst $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);\n\t\t\tconst esc = (value) =>\n\t\t\t\tString(value ?? '').replace(\n\t\t\t\t\t/[&<>\"']/g,\n\t\t\t\t\t(c) => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' })[c]\n\t\t